dell1320c includes material derived from the Fuji Xerox driver for the DocuPrint C525 A. That material is not covered by the MIT License in LICENSE.

- The color tables in data/color/ were recorded from the output of the Fuji Xerox driver's color correction step.

- The expected output in test/golden/expected/ was recorded from the Fuji Xerox driver. It is used only by the tests and is not installed.

No license from Fuji Xerox is known to cover this material.

The SQ21 compression in this driver is based on the reverse engineering done by the biosed/dell-1320c-cups-driver project (https://github.com/biosed/dell-1320c-cups-driver).
